{"id":10038,"name":"gengar-mega","speciesId":94,"dex":94,"form":"mega","generation":1,"types":["ghost","poison"],"stats":{"hp":60,"attack":65,"defense":80,"special-attack":170,"special-defense":95,"speed":130},"abilities":[{"name":"shadow-tag","hidden":false}],"height":14,"weight":405,"baseExp":270,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10038.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10038.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10038.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10038.ogg","genus":"Shadow Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Under a full moon, this POKéMON likes to mimic the shadows of people and laugh at their fright."},{"version":"yellow","text":"A GENGAR is close by if you feel a sudden chill. It may be trying to lay a curse on you."},{"version":"gold","text":"It steals heat from its surround­ ings. If you feel a sudden chill, it is certain that a GENGAR appeared."},{"version":"silver","text":"To steal the life of its target, it slips into the prey's shadow and silently waits for an opportunity."},{"version":"crystal","text":"Hiding in people's shadows at night, it absorbs their heat. The chill it causes makes the victims shake."},{"version":"ruby","text":"Sometimes, on a dark night, your shadow thrown by a streetlight will suddenly and startlingly overtake you. It is actually a GENGAR running past you, pretending to be your shadow."},{"version":"emerald","text":"Deep in the night, your shadow cast by a streetlight may suddenly overtake you. It is actually a GENGAR running past you, pretending to be your shadow."},{"version":"firered","text":"It is said to emerge from darkness to steal the lives of those who become lost in mountains."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"On the night of a full moon, if shadows move on their own and laugh, it must be GENGAR’s doing."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It hides in shadows. It is said that if GENGAR is hiding, it cools the area by nearly 10 degrees F."},{"version":"pearl","text":"Lurking in the shadowy corners of rooms, it awaits chances to steal its prey’s life force."},{"version":"platinum","text":"The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a GENGAR delighting in casting curses on people."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It steals heat from its surroundings. If you feel a sudden chill, it is certain that a GENGAR appeared."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"To steal the life of its target, it slips into the prey’s shadow and silently waits for an opportunity."},{"version":"black","text":"The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a Gengar delighting in casting curses on people."},{"version":"x","text":"It hides in shadows. It is said that if Gengar is hiding, it cools the area by nearly 10 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"version":"y","text":"Hiding in people’s shadows at night, it absorbs their heat. The chill it causes makes the victims shake."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sometimes, on a dark night, your shadow thrown by a streetlight will suddenly and startlingly overtake you. It is actually a Gengar running past you, pretending to be your shadow."},{"version":"sun","text":"Should you feel yourself attacked by a sudden chill, it is evidence of an approaching Gengar. There is no escaping it. Give up."},{"version":"moon","text":"It apparently wishes for a traveling companion. Since it was once human itself, it tries to create one by taking the lives of other humans."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"You can hear tales told all over the world about how Gengar will pay a visit to children who are naughty."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Even your home isn’t safe. Gengar will lurk in whatever dark corner of a room it can find and wait for its chance to catch its prey."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"A Gengar is close by if you feel a sudden chill. It may be trying to lay a curse on you."},{"version":"sword","text":"On the night of a full moon, if shadows move on their own and laugh, it must be Gengar’s doing."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Possesses potential victims' shadows in an effort to steal away the victims' lives. If your shadow begins to laugh, you must take hold of a protective charm posthaste!"}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["indeterminate"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"gastly","speciesId":92,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 25"],"species":"haunter","speciesId":93,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Troca"],"species":"gengar","speciesId":94,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":94,"name":"gengar","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/94.png"},{"id":10038,"name":"gengar-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10038.png"},{"id":10202,"name":"gengar-gmax","form":"gmax","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10202.png"}],"games":[15,16,17,18,19],"moves":[{"id":7,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":8,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":9,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":50,"learn":[[19,"lv",1]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":69,"learn":[[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":70,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":72,"learn":[[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":85,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":87,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":92,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"lv",21],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":94,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0